{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "{\n  \"acceptance\": \"The book method of BerthSchedule accepts a booking that starts exactly when another booking on the same berth ends (and one that ends exactly when another starts); bookings that genuinely overlap on the same berth are still refused.\",\n  \"area\": \"berths\",\n  \"description\": \"Planners cannot book a vessel onto a berth at the exact time the previous vessel leaves it. A booking that ends at noon and the next one starting at noon do not overlap, but the schedule reports a clash.\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"src/berths/schedule.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"INC-94\",\n  \"priority\": \"P2\",\n  \"reported\": \"2026-08-18\",\n  \"reporter\": \"berth-planning\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"title\": \"Back-to-back berth bookings are rejected\"\n}", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_0141NinpAB6BwuDnRqixr9Gk", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "73f21df0-09db-4833-97d5-56ff61e79516", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:03.049Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "{\n  \"acceptance\": \"The book method of BerthSchedule accepts a booking that starts exactly when another booking on the same berth ends (and one that ends exactly when another starts); bookings that genuinely overlap on the same berth are still refused.\",\n  \"area\": \"berths\",\n  \"description\": \"Planners cannot book a vessel onto a berth at the exact time the previous vessel leaves it. A booking that ends at noon and the next one starting at noon do not overlap, but the schedule reports a clash.\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"src/berths/schedule.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"INC-94\",\n  \"priority\": \"P2\",\n  \"reported\": \"2026-08-18\",\n  \"reporter\": \"berth-planning\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"title\": \"Back-to-back berth bookings are rejected\"\n}"}, "type": "user"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "Now I understand the issue. INC-94 is about back-to-back berth bookings being incorrectly rejected. A booking that ends at noon and the next one starting at noon should be allowed, but the schedule is reporting a clash. Let me look at the schedule code.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9EeoNLcDcATgKXWk1d", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "73f21df0-09db-4833-97d5-56ff61e79516", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:05.769Z", "type": "assistant"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"id": "toolu_0179dLo1tPkuqcPG7ipkjfmC", "input": {"file_path": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch/src/berths/schedule.ts"}, "name": "Read", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9EeoNLcDcATgKXWk1d", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "73f21df0-09db-4833-97d5-56ff61e79516", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:07.181Z", "type": "assistant"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "1\timport type { Booking } from \"@harbor/dispatch/types\";\n2\t\n3\tfunction overlaps(a: Booking, b: Booking): boolean {\n4\t  return a.start.getTime() <= b.end.getTime() && b.start.getTime() <= a.end.getTime();\n5\t}\n6\t\n7\texport class BerthSchedule {\n8\t  #bookings: Booking[] = [];\n9\t\n10\t  book(booking: Booking): void {\n11\t    if (booking.end.getTime() <= booking.start.getTime()) {\n12\t      throw new RangeError(\"a booking must end after it starts\");\n13\t    }\n14\t    const clash = this.#bookings.find((b) => b.berth === booking.berth && overlaps(b, booking));\n15\t    if (clash) {\n16\t      throw new Error(`berth ${booking.berth} is already booked for ${clash.vessel}`);\n17\t    }\n18\t    this.#bookings.push(booking);\n19\t  }\n20\t\n21\t  bookingsFor(berth: string): Booking[] {\n22\t    return this.#bookings\n23\t      .filter((b) => b.berth === berth)\n24\t      .sort((a, b) => a.start.getTime() - b.start.getTime());\n25\t  }\n26\t}\n27\t", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_0179dLo1tPkuqcPG7ipkjfmC", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "73f21df0-09db-4833-97d5-56ff61e79516", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:07.227Z", "toolUseResult": {}, "type": "user"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "I found the issue! The `overlaps` function is using `<=` comparisons which incorrectly considers back-to-back bookings as overlapping. When one booking ends at time T and another starts at time T, they don't actually overlap—they just touch. Let me check if there are tests to understand the expected behavior better.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9ExbStbSW8uAsETU2m", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "73f21df0-09db-4833-97d5-56ff61e79516", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:10.872Z", "type": "assistant"}
